  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A stationary loudspeaker emits sound waves of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> and frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. A person on a bicycle is moving away from the loudspeaker. </p>\n<p>What is true about the wavelength and the frequency of the sound wave as detected by the person?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><strong>Detected wavelength</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Detected frequency</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n<td>Lower than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Same as <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n<td>Lower than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n<td>Same as <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Same as <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></td>\n<td>Same as <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
